  "makkah_live.title": "Makkah Live Stream",
  "makkah_live.subtitle": "Watch the Holy Kaaba live 24/7",
  "makkah_live.watch_now": "Watch Live Now",
  "makkah_live.desc": "Experience the blessed view of Masjid al-Haram",
  "makkah_live.open_stream": "Open YouTube Stream",
  "makkah_live.about_title": "About Makkah",
  "makkah_live.about_p1": "Makkah (Mecca) is the holiest city in Islam and the birthplace of Prophet Muhammad (peace be upon him). It is home to the Kaaba, the most sacred site in Islam, located within Masjid al-Haram (The Sacred Mosque).",
  "makkah_live.about_p2": "Muslims around the world face the direction of the Kaaba during their five daily prayers, and it is the focal point of the annual Hajj pilgrimage, one of the Five Pillars of Islam.",
  "makkah_live.about_p3": "The live stream allows Muslims worldwide to connect with the holy site, observe prayers, and feel spiritually closer to this blessed location at any time.",
